RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYDAY=1WE
SUMMARY:Open Source Design monthly call
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our monthly get together where we talk about all things Open Source Design. Everyone is welcome.\nThese monthly meetings happen as a voice/video call using Jitsi at meet.jit.si/opensourcedesign.\nTo see what we talked about in previous meetings\, check out the “Monthly call” category on the forum.\nTo get notifications of this meeting and other events\, you can subscribe to our Open Source Design events calendar: Open Source Design calendar\n
LOCATION:Online
URL:https://opensourcedesign.net/pr-preview/pr-631/events/monthly-online-meeting/
